@host = http://localhost:5099
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@budgetPlanId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Create a user (copy the returned "id" into @userId above)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ada@example.com",
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Lovelace",
  "chronotype": "MorningLark",
  "preferredWorkStart": "08:00:00",
  "preferredWorkEnd": "16:00:00"
}

### Get the user
GET {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}

### Ingest a Second Brain node (multipart; File is optional).
# Enqueues embed+link work and returns 202 + correlationId to subscribe to on /hubs/agent.
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/brain/ingest
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----chronaiq

------chronaiq
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Title"

Distributed systems reading notes
------chronaiq
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Content"

Notes on consensus, Raft leader election, and quorum reads in Postgres clusters.
------chronaiq
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="SourceType"

Document
------chronaiq--

### Semantic search across the Second Brain
GET {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/brain/search?q=consensus%20and%20quorum&limit=5

### Create a task
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design the pgvector index strategy",
  "description": "Decide HNSW parameters",
  "energyRequirement": 5,
  "durationMinutes": 90
}

### Auto-schedule unscheduled tasks (chronotype-aware)
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/tasks/auto-schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reschedule": false }

### Create a budget plan (copy the returned "id" into @budgetPlanId above)
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/budgets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "2026 Household",
  "monthlyIncome": 6500.00,
  "monthlySavingsTarget": 1200.00,
  "startDate": "2026-01-01"
}

### Add a transaction
POST {{host}}/api/budgets/{{budgetPlanId}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 82.40,
  "merchantName": "Whole Foods",
  "category": "Groceries",
  "transactionDate": "2026-03-05T12:00:00Z"
}

### Forecast spend (ML.NET) for the next 3 months
GET {{host}}/api/budgets/{{budgetPlanId}}/forecast?horizon=3

### Kick off a multi-agent conversation (202 + correlationId → subscribe on /hubs/agent)
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/agents/converse
Content-Type: application/json

{ "prompt": "Where should I focus this week across tasks, budget, and notes?" }

### Async budget analysis via the agent pipeline
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/agents/analyze-budget
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgetPlanId": "{{budgetPlanId}}" }

### Async schedule via the agent pipeline
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/agents/schedule
